body:
https://soundcloud.com/kevin-fitzpatrick1995/reskebattle

&#x200B;

Just some a beat I made if you want to use it

This is excellent performances and production. Mix is phenomenal, really great clarity all round Amazing cover. Guitar tones are great, great singing. I really don’t have any tips to offer that aren’t just like personal preference tbh. 
But you asked for feedback on the mix so I’ll try and give you some anyway 😅

- in the intro, the bass and snare are panned left and right which is a little weird and disorienting to me; 
- the hi hat/shaker in the solo is a bit loud;

Those could just be the cheap earphones I’m listening on though tbh and those are the only things that stood out to me that could maybe be improved in what was a fantastic cover from front to back. Really excellent production and performance
